<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia Labs started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia Labs started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James analyst Jacqueline Siegel said she initiated coverage of Columbia Laboratories Inc with a buy rating, setting a 12-month price target of $23 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Estimates company will post a loss of $0.09 a share in 1997 and profits of $0.35 in 1998 and $1.07 in 1999.</p>
<p>-- Cited potential of company's Crinone hormone replacement drug.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/2 at 15-1/8.</p>
</text>
